id: inherited-creativity
name: Inherited Creativity
order: 3
optionOf: warrior-of-two-worlds
description: >
  Increase the amount of Technique Points you gain from Skill Improvements by 3 and reduce the Ki Point Cost of your Signature Techniques by 1(T).
text: >
  Inherited Creativity [Passive]: Increase the amount of Technique Points you gain from Skill Improvements by 3 and reduce the Ki Point Cost of your Signature Techniques by 1(T).

---

# (3) On every Skill Improvement row, as Gifted Student's; and off every Signature Technique's Ki.
[passive]
techniquePoints.perSkillImprovement += 3;
signature.kiCost -= 1(T);

# (4) At the start of a turn: a Signature Technique made then - no Technique Points spent, its cap the base Tier's, no
# Disadvantages - gone at the end of the Combat Encounter (moments-runtime.mjs encounterTechnique).
[triggered/start-of-turn, 1/encounter, effect 4]
encounterTechnique();
